# Trusted peer metadata URLs for CHIMERA update fallback.
#
# One URL per line. Use only peers you already trust operationally.
# The launcher normalizes each entry to /metadata.json and does not execute
# a peer bootstrap script during peer fallback.
#
# Examples:
# http://peer.example:18179
# http://peer.example:18179/metadata.json
# https://peer.example:18179/chimera.sh
# https://peer.example:18179/chimera-pq-release.tar.gz
